# Intake parser

Read `docs/AGENT_HANDOFF_INTAKE_PARSER.md` for sample collection / AI.

- **Rules (all paths):** 오피스텔(방/화 기본 1·1), `주`/`임`/`세`, `관`·`엘`·`보`·`매`, 애매한 `.` `,`는 내용, 둘째 값→내용. Message/photo/mic share `parseIntakeText`.
- **AI (message/photo only):** leftover after rules → `POST /api/intake-ai` (DeepSeek V4 Flash). Empty fields + memo only; never overwrite. Empty 거래종류·보증금·월세 may be filled; phone / room-bath / 유무 stay rules-only. Fail → rules still apply. Mic / `intakeSteps.ts`: no AI.
- **Env:** `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in `.env.local` (local) or Vercel env (prod). Admin 파서 tab shows 설정됨/없음, never the key.
- **Guard:** leftover empty skip; auth required; 8/min · 40/hour · 80/day per user; same leftover 90s skip. Fail (key/balance) → that apply uses rules; next apply tries AI again. Mic: no AI.
- **Errors:** `[AI] …` on admin 에러 tab.
- **PRs (draft):** #7 parser, #8 samples. Migration `021_intake_parse_samples.sql` before prod 파서 tab.
